  {
   "id": "digimon-story-time-stranger-331188@post-2025-10-10",
   "gameId": "digimon-story-time-stranger-331188",
   "displayName": "2025/10/10　Patch Notes",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-10-10T09:17:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "An update for Digimon Story Time Stranger will be released on October 10, 2025.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To ensure the best gameplay experience, please make sure to apply the latest update before playing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Details of the update are as follows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "==========",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "◆Update Version",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam：20280266",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■Bond",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To enhance the importance of Bond in battles, the following effects have been added and adjusted:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the activation rate of Extra Strikes based on Bond beyond previous values.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a new effect: higher Bond increases CRT Rate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a new effect: higher Bond increases Item Drop and Rare Drop Rates.: *Only the Digimon with the highest Bond among battle members will affect Item Drop Rates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated Tutorial text to reflect the above changes.: ■Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue on certain Steam® environments where missing or corrupted system data from the demo caused save data transfer to the full version to malfunction.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug in the \"Factorial Area\" where crane states were not saved correctly, potentially causing progression to be blocked.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where trophies/achievements could not be unlocked under specific conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug in the boss battle against \"Greymon (Blue)\" where progression was blocked unless all in-battle dialogue events were viewed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash that could occur when repeatedly opening and closing the Digivice menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash that could occur in certain \"Outer Dungeon\" when performing DigiAttack under specific conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where enemy HP gauges were not displayed during battle under certain conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where Aegiomon's attachment skill reverted to its previous state under specific conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where Aegiomon's HP/SP did not recover properly under certain conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug in specific areas of \"The In-Between Theater,\" \"Gear Forest,\" and \"Abyss Surface\" where movement was restricted, preventing progression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue in the final boss battle where progression was blocked or unintended behavior occurred if Aegiomon was incapacitated under specific conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where non-guest Aegiomon equipped with items like \"Crimson Dragon Data Fragment\" appeared as Aegiochusmon only during battle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various usability improvements and fixes to backgrounds, models, and text.: ==========: Thank you and please enjoy the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
